  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of <br>olive oil over medium-high heat.<br>• When the oil is hot, fry gnocchi, tossing <br>occasionally, until golden, 6-8 minutes. Transfer <br>to a bowl.</p> <p><br>TIP: Add extra oil if the gnocchi sticks to the pan. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6819903e939c9c3068924f4f/step-0b7a3800.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic and parsley.<br>• Zest lemon to get a pinch, then slice into <br>wedges.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6819903e939c9c3068924f4f/step-2fb13210.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Return pan to medium-high heat with a good <br>drizzle of olive oil.<br>• Cook panko breadcrumbs (see ingredients), <br>stirring, until golden brown, 2-3 minutes.<br>• Add garlic, parsley and lemon zest and cook <br>until fragrant, 1 minute. Transfer to a bowl and <br>season with salt and pepper to taste.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6819903e939c9c3068924f4f/step-bab7ac20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Wipe out frying pan and return to medium-high <br>heat with a good drizzle of marinated goat <br>cheese oil.<br>• Cook sliced mushrooms, tossing, until browned <br>and softened, 6-8 minutes. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6819903e939c9c3068924f4f/step-4227bc30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Reduce heat to medium, then stir in light <br>cooking cream, stock concentrate, a good <br>squeeze of lemon juice and a splash of water<br>until combined, 1 minute.<br>• Remove pan from heat, then add baby spinach <br>leaves and cooked gnocchi, tossing until wilted <br>and combined. Season generously with pepper. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6819903e939c9c3068924f4f/step-2e5e4740.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide mushroom gnocchi between bowls. <br>• Crumble over goat cheese and top with herby <br>garlic crumb. <br>• Serve with remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6819903e939c9c3068924f4f/step-c34dbd50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
